{% if is_template %}A project's [`lifecycle`](template-questions.md#lifecycle-pre-alpha-alpha-beta-stable-inactive) (Pre-Alpha, Alpha, Beta, Stable, or Inactive){% else %}This project's lifecycle state (currently {{ lifecycle }}){% endif %} drives a managed notice at the top of the README. Lifecycle only moves forward (Pre-Alpha to Alpha to Beta to Stable); Inactive is reachable from any state. Change it with `mise run set-lifecycle`.
